1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:05,243
A canal with gondolas, at a Las Vegas
hotel where every room is a suite.

2
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:11,341
This is the Venetian Resort Las Vegas, a
five star resort on the Strip, made for

3
00:00:11,371 --> 00:00:14,802
couples and first timers who want one
luxury base.

4
00:00:14,932 --> 00:00:19,236
Four pools, twenty restaurants, and a
casino, all in one place.

5
00:00:19,366 --> 00:00:23,495
Here is how I would plan your stay, and my
honest score comes at the end.

6
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:25,195
Start with the canal.

7
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,489
Take a gondola ride along the indoor Grand
Canal, ten to thirteen minutes long, with

8
00:00:30,519 --> 00:00:31,712
a singing gondolier.

9
00:00:31,842 --> 00:00:36,326
Rides run from ten in the morning until
ten at night, and until eleven on Fridays

10
00:00:36,356 --> 00:00:40,895
and Saturdays, and a shared gondola is
about thirty-nine dollars per person,
which

11
00:00:40,925 --> 00:00:41,397
is extra.

12
00:00:41,527 --> 00:00:43,097
Now, where you sleep.

13
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:48,128
Every room is a suite, from six hundred
fifty square feet, with a sunken living

14
00:00:48,158 --> 00:00:48,427
room.

15
00:00:48,557 --> 00:00:51,140
Beds come with Egyptian cotton and a
pillow top.

16
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,098
Bathrooms have deep soaking tubs.

17
00:00:53,228 --> 00:00:55,197
Some suites look out at the Sphere.

18
00:00:55,327 --> 00:00:58,213
Guests rate cleanliness nine point six out
of ten.

19
00:00:58,343 --> 00:00:59,484
Now, the pools.

20
00:00:59,709 --> 00:01:04,720
There are four outdoor pools, with
loungers, umbrellas, cabanas, and a
lifeguard.

21
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:09,712
There is a poolside bar too, but I could
not find pool hours, so check them when
you

22
00:01:09,742 --> 00:01:10,003
book.

23
00:01:10,133 --> 00:01:11,489
Now, food and fun.

24
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:16,687
Expedia lists twenty restaurants, four
bars and lounges, and six cafés.

25
00:01:16,817 --> 00:01:20,947
BRERA Osteria serves Italian food, open
daily, with a happy hour.

26
00:01:21,077 --> 00:01:25,647
Estiatorio Milos is Mediterranean fine
dining, also open daily.

27
00:01:25,875 --> 00:01:30,412
Breakfast is cooked to order from six to
eleven in the morning, and it costs extra.

28
00:01:30,542 --> 00:01:34,791
The spa has hydrotherapy, massage, a steam
room, and a sauna.

29
00:01:34,921 --> 00:01:36,844
The gym is open twenty-four hours.

30
00:01:36,974 --> 00:01:41,375
And the casino has one hundred fifteen
tables and one thousand one hundred forty

31
00:01:41,405 --> 00:01:41,707
slots.

32
00:01:41,837 --> 00:01:45,017
There are shows, a nightclub, and a
sportsbook too.

33
00:01:45,147 --> 00:01:49,419
The Sphere is eight hundred meters away,
the airport is a twelve minute drive, and

34
00:01:49,449 --> 00:01:51,465
Treasure Island is a three minute walk.

35
00:01:51,595 --> 00:01:53,725
A few things to know before you go.

36
00:01:53,855 --> 00:01:57,354
There is a daily resort fee, which covers
WiFi and the gym.

37
00:01:57,484 --> 00:02:00,840
Parking costs extra, and a car is
recommended.

38
00:02:01,004 --> 00:02:05,190
Check-in is from three in the afternoon
until midnight, and you must be twenty-
one.

39
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:07,792
Breakfast is extra, and the spa needs a
reservation.

40
00:02:07,922 --> 00:02:09,992
You can choose your view when you book.

41
00:02:10,122 --> 00:02:12,060
So, is the Venetian worth it?

42
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:16,767
On Expedia, guests give it nine point four
out of ten, from nineteen thousand

43
00:02:16,797 --> 00:02:17,904
sixty-four reviews.

44
00:02:18,034 --> 00:02:22,966
Cleanliness scores nine point six,
amenities nine point four, and service
nine point

45
00:02:22,996 --> 00:02:23,261
four.

46
00:02:23,391 --> 00:02:25,316
My honest score is nine out of ten.

47
00:02:25,446 --> 00:02:30,406
It is great for couples and first timers
who want a suite, a canal, and a pool in

48
00:02:30,436 --> 00:02:31,022
one place.

49
00:02:31,152 --> 00:02:33,436
The link is in the description.
